@startuml
!theme plain
title UI State Machine - Content Draft

[*] --> Idea
Idea --> Briefing : generate brief
Briefing --> Generated : generation ok
Briefing --> GenerationError : provider error
GenerationError --> Briefing : retry
Generated --> NeedsReview : open review
NeedsReview --> Approved : human approve
NeedsReview --> Rejected : reject
NeedsReview --> Generated : request variation
Approved --> Scheduling : schedule
Scheduling --> Scheduled : postiz ok
Scheduling --> ScheduleError : postiz failed
ScheduleError --> Scheduling : retry
Scheduled --> Published : postiz status published
Scheduled --> Cancelled : cancel
Published --> Measured : import metrics
Rejected --> Archived
Cancelled --> Archived
Measured --> [*]
@enduml

